<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86206" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῆσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Schwyzer</u>
			688
		</span></i><i><span class="en">
			<u>C</u>
			6
		</span></i> (Chios, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
		</span></i> (v. infr.), ἡ: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρνημι</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sale,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠνῇ τε καὶ πρήσι χρέωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.153
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				909
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				223d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πρήσι</span> for <i>sale,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ πρᾶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
					63.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶσιν ἐποιήσατο τοῦ ἀγῶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.115
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὑρεῖν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					567
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. αἰτεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					225
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1291a5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of legal
			documents, <i>contract for farming of taxes, sale,</i> etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				55.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				95.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.</div>
